WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.967
Hi, we just got in. Is there anything we should know about the house?

00:00:05.267 --> 00:00:07.567
<v Atlas>Shoes off at the door, please.

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:13.367
Your guests just ask. The house answers.

00:00:13.967 --> 00:00:15.367
What's the wifi password?

00:00:16.633 --> 00:00:18.700
<v Atlas>sunflower twenty twenty six.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.467
Turn on the terrace lights.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.733
<v Atlas>Done, I turned on Terrace Lights.

00:00:26.133 --> 00:00:27.500
Where should we park the car?

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.733
<v Atlas>The driveway on the left side, please.
